# README for go

Go 1.8.7 is the last version that fully supports older PowerPC64 systems
without requiring POWER8+ features as VSX.

Later Go releases introduce instructions and runtime assumptions that cause
illegal instruction faults on hardware like the PowerMac G5.

Using Go 1.8.7 ensures maximum compatibility with big-endian ppc64 (ELFv1)
environments. This makes it the safest choice for boostraping and building
software on legacy PowerPC64 hardware.
